WEBVTT

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.080
Oh...

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.660
The first rays of the sun seen

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:11.660
through my vampire eyes...

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:18.000
It's morning already. We'd better

00:00:13.160 --> 00:00:18.000
get back before Lord Kaname returns.

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.080
Yes.

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:22.290
...was not gentle at all.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.910
I smell blood...Kaname's blood.

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.080
I know you're experiencing

00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.080
many sensations,

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.200
but if we don't return,

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:35.200
Lord Kaname will be worried.

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:39.250
But...I have a bad feeling...

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:44.040
Like it's being dragged here

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:44.040
and getting closer.

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.000
My master...

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:58.080
This academy is no longer

00:00:53.660 --> 00:00:58.080
a little garden of tranquility.

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:01.830
Order all students to return home.

00:02:43.290 --> 00:02:44.370
Until further notice from the Headmaster,

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.370
PRELUDE TO BATTLE

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:45.370
Until further notice from the Headmaster,

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:46.910
PRELUDE TO BATTLE

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:46.910
you will all be staying home.

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:48.450
PRELUDE TO BATTLE

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:48.450
When you are packed,

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:51.410
please proceed to Building 12

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:51.410
and follow Mr. Yagari's instructions.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:53.410
Where are you going?

00:02:53.660 --> 00:02:55.080
To get Mr. Bear.

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:56.410
What's that?

00:02:56.950 --> 00:02:58.120
My teddy bear.

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.790
Something like that?!

00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.790
Can be left behind.

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:04.160
I don't quite understand,

00:03:01.410 --> 00:03:04.160
but make it quick!

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:12.330
Wakaba, what are you doing?

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:14.200
The Class President says to hurry.

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:15.290
But...

00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:16.290
Come on, let's hurry!

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:21.370
I wanted to take it slow and

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:21.370
demonstrate at this academy...

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:25.950
That there are vampires

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:25.950
with whom we can coexist...

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:31.120
It's too bad you didn't

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:31.120
realize your goal.

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:34.750
No, it's not over yet.

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:37.910
Not yet.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.410
I'm taking Shiki.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.160
He has no need of him anymore.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:50.700
As you please.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:09.620
Lady Shizuka... It's almost time.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:09.620
Just a little longer.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.700
This way! Be quick about it!

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:14.580
I didn't know there was a path here.

00:04:15.080 --> 00:04:16.790
I heard it's an emergency exit.

00:04:18.200 --> 00:04:20.790
Say, Shindo, have you seen Yuki?

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:24.120
Huh? I thought you knew, Wakaba.

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.750
I know there's something

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.750
Yuki isn't telling me.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.080
She doesn't want me to worry,

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:32.080
so she hasn't been able to confide in me.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:36.040
But that makes me sad, Yuki.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.500
Hey, I said to hurry,

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:40.500
but put on your shoes!

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:45.330
This ominous feeling...

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:45.330
I know it!

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:51.000
Is it all right to let

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:51.000
the students outside?

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:56.910
Kaname's orders are to prevent

00:04:52.040 --> 00:04:56.910
any Day Class students from coming to harm.

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.700
That's if they're able to get out safely.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:02.250
What's that?

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:03.250
An elevator?

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:05.040
Everyone here? Let's go.

00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:06.450
Please wait!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.700
Not everyone's here!

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.700
Several female students are missing!

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:11.410
I'm responsible!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.120
I told them time

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.120
and time again to hurry!

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.250
They didn't make it in time?

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:20.580
Gather all the students

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:20.580
in the auditorium.

00:05:20.580 --> 00:05:21.620
I'll handle here.

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:22.620
All right.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:25.500
We have a change of plans.

00:05:22.620 --> 00:05:25.500
Proceed to the auditorium immediately!

00:05:26.410 --> 00:05:27.750
Hurry it up!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.120
Forgive me, Juri.

00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:33.580
In order to fulfill your wish, I...

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:37.040
I cannot keep my promise to you.

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:49.450
Say, maybe this wasn't a good idea.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:52.540
But we won't be seeing

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:52.540
the Night Class for awhile.

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.120
I'm already getting

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.120
withdrawal symptoms!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.410
Good morning, young ladies.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.330
Young girls are so full of energy

00:05:57.200 --> 00:06:00.330
in the morning.

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:02.660
I used to be like that long ago.

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:04.410
You can be...

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.620
my presents to my master!

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:17.580
Y-You bastard!

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:20.660
Akatsuki, why did you

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:20.660
go so easy on her?

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:27.040
Those vampires are ex-humans.

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:27.040
I wonder whose servants they are.

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:29.790
This is Lord Kaname's territory.

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:32.870
Anyone who intrudes

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:32.870
will be shown no mercy!

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.080
Kaien Cross.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:03.330
The legendary Hunter known as

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:03.330
the strongest in history.

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:06.370
Thank you for

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:06.370
protecting the students.

00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.500
Don't mention it.

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.830
The real attack will no doubt

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.830
begin after sundown.

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:11.620
We cannot let down our guard.

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:16.370
Fighting vampires with vampires...

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:16.370
Isn't it ironic?

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.620
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:23.370
Something is about to happen.

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:23.370
I have to stop it.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:25.330
Look you!

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:29.160
If anything happens to you,

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:29.160
I will get it from Lord Kaname.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:33.790
I may have become a vampire,

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:33.790
but I'm still a Guardian of this academy.

00:07:38.790 --> 00:07:39.790
But...

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:41.540
Huh?!

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:43.410
Aghhh! Geez!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:58.040
Hello, young lady.

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:01.330
We've been looking for

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:01.330
a gift for our master

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.750
whom we haven't seen

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:03.750
for a long time.

00:08:04.450 --> 00:08:05.450
Who are you?

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:08.540
You don't need...to know!

00:08:11.910 --> 00:08:12.910
Yori!

00:08:13.790 --> 00:08:14.790
Are you all right?!

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:16.830
Yuki!

00:08:17.540 --> 00:08:18.540
You...

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:20.790
Stand back!

00:08:21.450 --> 00:08:23.750
She's...the Pureblood Princess!

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:26.620
So this princess is his...

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:30.370
I will not forgive anyone

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:30.370
who tries to hurt Yori!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.330
Huh... Why?!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.290
For our master!

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.040
You're no match for me.

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:54.330
Yuki, you...

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.410
I'm sorry, Yori.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:01.160
Those people that disintegrated...

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:01.160
are just like me.

00:09:03.910 --> 00:09:06.450
I'm sorry you had such a fright.

00:09:09.290 --> 00:09:10.290
Stupid!

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:14.080
If you apologize to me

00:09:11.450 --> 00:09:14.080
with such a sad expression,

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.580
I'll feel sad too.

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:21.660
I was more frightened when

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:21.660
my dear friend didn't return,

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:23.000
and I didn't know why.

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:25.370
Yori...

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:26.580
Yuki...

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:28.540
Kaname...

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:30.700
What are you doing here?

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:35.160
Something is happening

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:35.160
at the academy, isn't it?

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.040
That's why, I...

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:43.700
You mustn't be reckless.

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:43.700
Your condition is still unstable.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.500
Take Yuki to a quiet place

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:47.500
so that she can rest.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:48.830
Yes.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:52.540
Kaname, there are people

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:52.540
I want to protect too!

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:55.330
Even though you can't

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:55.330
hold onto the Artemis Rod?

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:02.410
Let us go, Lady Yuki.

00:10:06.200 --> 00:10:07.200
Yuki...

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:09.500
Oh!

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:14.660
No matter what happens,

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:14.660
we're best friends forever.

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:16.750
Yori...

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:26.290
Good job.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.830
What's with that dark look?

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:33.000
In order to protect Zero,

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:33.000
you made him hunt.

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:37.580
But when you return to your old job,

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:37.580
you can't handle it mentally?

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:40.450
You, the legendary one.

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:46.330
It may sound selfish,

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:46.330
but I wanted to erase such a legend.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:50.700
If I let myself be proud

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:50.700
of hunting vampires,

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:55.370
I would be denying Yuki, Zero

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:55.370
and the Night Class the right to exist.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:02.040
The fact is I've killed

00:10:56.950 --> 00:11:02.040
too many vampires.

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:07.080
But I haven't lost my ability

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:07.080
to discern what I need to do.

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:10.410
I'm going to see

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:10.410
the Society President.

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:13.120
I intend to settle this!

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.700
You have lost your ability!

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.790
You have your work to do,

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.790
don't you, Headmaster?

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:25.500
Frankly, I'm tired of babysitting kids.

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:25.500
I'm not suited to this.

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:32.080
I'm still an active Hunter.

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:32.080
I'll show you that I'm useful.

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:36.200
And besides, such talk

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:36.200
doesn't suit you, old man.

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:37.870
Yagari...

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:42.080
Smoking on school grounds

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:42.080
is prohibited!

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:56.870
I thought you were

00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:56.870
early-risers for vampires,

00:11:57.750 --> 00:11:58.950
but I see you're human guests.

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:01.120
The president is extremely upset

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:03.200
since you have not reported

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:03.200
to the Society.

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:06.450
Hand Zero Kiryu over to us.

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:07.790
I refuse.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:08.790
- Wha—?!

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:08.790
- Wha—?!

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:12.250
We can't go back

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:12.250
empty-handed, Yagari.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:17.870
Then beat me first, if you can.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.290
A sword isn't bad.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:31.370
And it's pretty efficient

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:31.370
against humans too.

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:33.870
Just forget it.

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:36.250
We can attack together,

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.750
but we haven't got a chance

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:37.750
against you.

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:41.620
Yagari, why do you defy

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:41.620
the Society President's order?

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:45.450
Do you believe that his orders

00:12:42.620 --> 00:12:45.450
are always right?

00:12:48.870 --> 00:12:50.120
Give the President a message.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:53.330
If he has any complaints,

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:53.330
he can come here personally.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:06.500
Something is happening...

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:12.870
And that's making it boil...

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:12.870
the cursed blood flowing through me.

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:15.750
Zero...

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:17.620
Shut up...

00:13:19.500 --> 00:13:20.500
Zero!

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:22.500
Shut up!

00:13:26.750 --> 00:13:29.790
I want you to kill me.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.080
I knew nothing.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:36.830
I'm just glad that you're okay.

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.120
I tried to protect her, but...

00:13:41.660 --> 00:13:43.410
How could I hate you?

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:47.910
Right now, I'm overflowing with hate.

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:52.950
I think I was able to survive

00:13:48.870 --> 00:13:52.950
because you were around.

00:13:53.910 --> 00:13:55.660
But Yuki is already...

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.700
...that part of her was eaten up

00:13:56.160 --> 00:13:58.700
by the Yuki which is a vampire.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:00.370
...already...

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.910
It's quiet in here,

00:14:01.250 --> 00:14:02.910
so you'll be able to rest.

00:14:03.410 --> 00:14:04.410
This room...

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.410
I personally guarantee

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:07.410
that it's safe.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:09.910
A bell?

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:11.910
Is something the matter?

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:12.910
No, it's nothing.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.750
Rest a little.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.750
I mean, please rest a while.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:23.080
I can't rest. I worry about Yori

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:23.080
and everyone else in the academy.

00:14:25.080 --> 00:14:28.160
Still, please rest for now.

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:35.700
Now that you are a vampire,

00:14:31.290 --> 00:14:35.700
this is the time when you must sleep.

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:43.370
Kaname is...

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:43.370
the progenitor of Kuran vampires.

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:49.410
But Kaname, to me, you are

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:49.410
my precious friend from long ago.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:53.160
That's the only memory I have of you...

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:54.750
That's why...

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:59.370
Shiki, I'm sorry.

00:14:55.250 --> 00:14:59.370
I should have done this much sooner.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.040
But I hesitated and

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:03.040
put all of you through this.

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:06.370
I want to stay by you,

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:06.370
but I'm going...

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:11.580
To do what I must.

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:11.580
To end this curse!

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.870
Will seeing me...

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.870
resolve any of this?

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:28.290
...an arrogant Pureblood

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:28.290
who tampers with humans.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.200
Lady Shizuka...?

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:40.580
Unawares, your existence

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:40.580
went through a change.

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:44.500
I forgot about revenge...

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:48.910
And even went as far as considering

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:48.910
running away with you.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:58.750
It's useless. Even if humans

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:58.750
and Purebloods live together,

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:02.790
their destination is

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:02.790
the same as that man...hell.

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:07.000
I will not tell you my feelings.

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:12.290
And when my life is over,

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:12.290
instead of my heart,

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.250
I shall give you

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.250
my blood and flesh.

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:18.620
A truly fitting way for a vampire to love,

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:18.620
don't you think?

00:16:24.910 --> 00:16:28.200
I will not leave you alone.

00:16:29.910 --> 00:16:32.040
I'm sorry. I've woken you.

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:34.160
Kaname...

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:37.290
What's the matter?

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:40.830
Shizuka was just there.

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:46.790
Oh, this was the room Shizuka used,

00:16:41.620 --> 00:16:46.790
so you may have sensed something.

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:52.870
That woman's feelings,

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:52.870
always full of hate, came flowing in.

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:59.250
Unable to defy her fate as a Pureblood,

00:16:54.870 --> 00:16:59.250
she had faded alone and sad...

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:00.910
Her feelings.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:03.660
Yuki, are you all right?

00:17:06.410 --> 00:17:09.040
I will have to leave this place soon.

00:17:10.830 --> 00:17:12.160
You will come with me.

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:17.830
I can't. I can't leave everyone

00:17:13.040 --> 00:17:17.830
when things are so dangerous.

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:20.950
Your Artemis Rod

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:20.950
should have taught you.

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:25.580
You can no longer live

00:17:21.290 --> 00:17:25.580
as a human like before.

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:27.910
Even so...

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:30.950
I want to protect things

00:17:29.000 --> 00:17:30.950
that are precious to me.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:35.000
I once agreed to being

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:35.000
separated from you.

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:41.500
Will you make me suffer what I did

00:17:35.870 --> 00:17:41.500
these past ten years all over again?

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:47.250
I won't leave you all alone.

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:51.160
When the time comes,

00:17:48.910 --> 00:17:51.160
I will come for you.

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:53.790
Until then, rest awhile.

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:58.950
I'm sorry! I have no intention

00:17:54.830 --> 00:17:58.950
of causing you pain.

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:02.080
Yes, I know.

00:18:04.620 --> 00:18:05.620
I know.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:12.080
Defying Lord Kaname like that...

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:12.080
You have no concern for your life?

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:17.450
I didn't mean to.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:17.450
I'm just worried about everyone.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:19.450
Like Kiryu?

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:23.330
...an arrogant Pureblood

00:18:20.500 --> 00:18:23.330
who tampers with humans.

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:27.910
No, Zero is already...

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:44.750
I have been waiting anxiously

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:44.750
for your resurrection, Lord Rido.

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:52.830
This ominous feeling which I was

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:52.830
barely aware of just became intense.

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:56.370
Those sinister eyes...

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:58.330
I must go!

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.500
Have you forgotten what

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.500
Lord Kaname just told you?

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:05.080
I can't put everyone in danger

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:05.080
because of me!

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.370
I'm the Guardian of the academy!

00:19:07.370 --> 00:19:09.870
No! You are the Pureblood Princess!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:15.500
Yes, I know. But I've lived as a human.

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:19.450
Everyone has helped me,

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:19.450
and I've protected them.

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:27.500
If I'm denied that now, I won't know

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:27.500
how to live my life anymore!

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:31.620
But you can't even

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:31.620
hold Artemis Rod.

00:19:37.450 --> 00:19:38.450
If it's a gun...

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.620
You must be hungry!

00:19:44.620 --> 00:19:46.080
I'm not hungry.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.370
You are hungry.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.370
You must be hungry.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.620
Well, it can't be helped.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:51.620
I'll go and get something for you.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.290
Aido ...

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.250
Listen! Do not leave this room!

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:58.410
I won't lock this room,

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:58.410
but do not leave this room!

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.500
Aido...

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:09.370
Another Pureblood Vampire...

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:11.450
How disgusting.

00:20:12.200 --> 00:20:15.370
No, I'm wrong. She's...

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:22.500
Heh... What am I saying?

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:27.250
I'm surprised. I thought for a moment

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:27.250
that you were crying.

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:29.450
You're an eyesore. Get out.

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:34.080
Good. I need you to be feisty,

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:34.080
or I'll be in trouble.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.950
What kind of trouble?

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:42.040
The pawn I've carefully moved

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:42.040
for just over four years

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:44.870
is on the verge of devouring King.

00:20:45.500 --> 00:20:47.080
That pawn is you.

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:52.120
The monster, Rido,

00:20:47.620 --> 00:20:52.120
has awaken from his coffin

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.330
and you must destroy him.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.410
Have you lost your mind?

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.410
Do it yourself.

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:59.250
Will you persist in pretending

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:59.250
not to know?

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:04.330
That those things inside your body

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:04.330
have begun to pulsate...?

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:08.620
In the beginning, you unconsciously

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:08.620
stole the power from the other twin

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:12.330
while in your mother's womb,

00:21:08.620 --> 00:21:12.330
and born with the power

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:14.410
of one and a half persons

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:14.410
into a family of elite Hunters.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:19.700
It would have been less troublesome

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:19.700
if you had totally consumed the other.

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.000
Stop it!

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:25.410
Later, Shizuka turned you into a vampire...

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:27.000
And you have devoured, endlessly,

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.870
the blood of the one

00:21:27.000 --> 00:21:29.870
who watched over you so kindly, Yuki.

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:31.450
Don't say anymore!

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:35.450
And as Yuki has awakened,

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:35.450
so has her blood which flows inside you,

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:38.580
possessed with the power of the Kurans...

00:21:35.450 --> 00:21:38.580
coursing throughout your body.

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:39.580
Isn't that so?

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:45.700
And I took in Shizuka's blood and power,

00:21:40.450 --> 00:21:45.700
then offered you my own blood.

00:21:46.250 --> 00:21:48.000
It has all been for this day.

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:51.330
Soon, you will become

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:51.330
the ultimate Hunter.

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:57.620
You are the only one who can

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:57.620
free me from Rido's curse.

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:03.660
Do you really think I'll

00:21:59.660 --> 00:22:03.660
do as you wish just to save you?

00:22:05.160 --> 00:22:07.620
You cannot betray Yuki.

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:11.660
I am leaving this academy

00:22:09.000 --> 00:22:11.660
and taking Yuki with me.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:14.700
But as long as Rido is alive,

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:18.540
he will come after us,

00:22:14.700 --> 00:22:18.540
wanting to devour Yuki.

00:22:20.450 --> 00:22:21.540
Good bye.

00:23:59.160 --> 00:24:04.160
Next time:

00:23:59.160 --> 00:24:04.160
"Two Souls"
